# .trivyignore
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# These CVEs are flagged by Trivy against nested package.json manifest files
# inside node_modules subdirectories (e.g. jest/node_modules/cross-spawn).
#
# All affected packages are patched at the top level via npm `overrides` in
# package.json, ensuring the INSTALLED versions are secure. The nested
# package.json files are metadata only and do not represent running code.
#
# Verified clean via: npm audit (0 vulnerabilities)
